WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:05.590
In the name of the Father and of the Son and of the Holy Spirit, amen.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:12.350
The reading from the Sinaxadion, for June 6th, on which we commemorate our Righteous Father

00:00:12.350 --> 00:00:16.030
Ilarion, the new.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:21.030
On the 6th of the month we celebrate the memory of our venerable Father Ilarion, Abbot of the

00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:24.110
Monastery of Dalmatus.

00:00:24.110 --> 00:00:29.630
Our Holy Father Ilarion originally came from Cappadocia, where his father provided bread

00:00:29.630 --> 00:00:36.630
for the imperial palace and enjoyed a favored position, entering the monastery of Zerocopion

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:40.790
in Constantinople at the age of 20.

00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:48.550
He soon left it for the celebrated monastery of Dalmatus, where he was tonsored monk.

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:55.870
Humble and a lover of Hisichia, his obedience for ten years, was to work in the garden,

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.790
where his virtues shown forth.

00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:03.630
As he had cast out a demon from a young boy by his prayers, the Abbot ordered that he

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:08.110
be ordained priest, in spite of his reluctance.

00:01:08.110 --> 00:01:14.230
And sometime after the death of the Abbot, as the monks wished to make him Abbot, Ilarion

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:20.230
left to take refuge in the monastery of Katharra in Bithinia.

00:01:20.230 --> 00:01:25.870
The monks of Dalmatus, however, appealed to Patriarch Nikefodos and to the emperor, who

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:32.070
sent him back to their monastery, and he was named Abbot by the Holy Synod and the

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:38.550
Archimandrite of the monasteries of the capital in 807.

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:44.070
He was peacefully directing his spiritual flock, when Leo, the Armenian, began the iconoclast

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.710
persecution once more.

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:51.190
The saint was brought before the sovereign, who tried to make him renounce the veneration

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:58.110
of the holy icons, but he firmly stood his ground, treating the emperor as an atheist

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:01.150
and a new apostate.

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:07.350
Furious, Leo had him tortured and thrown into prison.

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:13.070
After a prolonged detention, Ilarion was brought before the emperor once more, where he repeated

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:15.390
his former words.

00:02:15.390 --> 00:02:21.630
Leo handed him over to the heretical patriarch, Thildotus Cassiteras, in the hope that the

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:28.870
latter would be able to convince the valiant confessor and, along with him, the powerful monastic

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.350
party.

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:38.950
Thildotus failed, and Ilarion was shut up in a dark dungeon, without food for many days.

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:44.430
His disciples, hearing that he was about to die from hunger, went to beg the emperor to

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:50.590
release him, promising that their spiritual father would submit to his will.

00:02:50.590 --> 00:02:56.870
Leo freed him and allowed him to return to his monastery, but he soon realized that he

00:02:56.870 --> 00:03:03.310
had acted like a fool, and the saint was shut up for six months in the monastery of

00:03:03.310 --> 00:03:09.630
funnels, on the bospheres, where he was subjected to ill treatment by the abbot, who had been

00:03:09.630 --> 00:03:13.790
one to the emperor's cause.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:18.770
After appearing once more before the tyrant, Ilarion was transferred to the monastery of

00:03:18.770 --> 00:03:25.510
Kiklobion, on the west side of the capital, where he remained for two and a half years,

00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:32.610
after which he was interned in the prison of the Numerians near the palace, once he was

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:38.950
taken to the fortress of Proteleon, after having been cruelly beaten.

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:43.470
After Leo was assassinated in the church where he had begun his persecution by throwing an

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:50.990
icon of Christ to the ground, Michael II, taking power, ordered that the confessors be freed

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.990
in 820.

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:57.950
Ilarion was released, but was forbidden to enter this city.

00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:03.950
He was given shelter for seven years by a devout Christian, until the beginning of Thelfilos'

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.750
reign.

00:04:05.750 --> 00:04:11.710
He, seeking out the monastic superiors who were confessors of the holy icons, had them brought

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:15.150
before him one by one.

00:04:15.150 --> 00:04:20.350
When they asked Ilarion whether he would submit to the imperial will, the saint condemned

00:04:20.350 --> 00:04:26.230
the tyrant, accusing him of being an impious deceiver.

00:04:26.230 --> 00:04:34.710
Without pity for his age, they inflicted 117 blows on him, and then had him deported to

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:39.470
the island of Afusia, to the south of Proponthes.

00:04:39.470 --> 00:04:46.030
There the saint dug out a narrow cell in the rock, and by his prayer made a spring of fresh

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:49.390
water flow from the rock.

00:04:49.390 --> 00:04:55.790
He spent eight years there in Hezekiah, until the death of Thelfilos and 842.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:02.190
Saint Ilarion was immediately authorized to return to Constantinople by the Empress Theodora,

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:06.790
and to take up the direction of his monastery once more.

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:12.870
Having been present at the triumphal restoration of Orthodoxy, he spent three years instructing

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:21.070
his monks in the holy traditions, shining radiantly by the sanctity of his life and his miracles.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:29.790
In 845, at the age of 70, he gave his soul into the Lord's hands.

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:36.790
Through the prayers of our Holy Fathers, O Lord, Jesus Christ our God, have mercy on us

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:37.630
and save us.
